=== Tarantula Broodfather ===
'''Tarantula Silk''' can drop from {{MobSprite|Tarantula Broodfather}} {{Stier|5}} with a weight of {{Green|2,000}}—resulting in a base drop chance of {{Green|14.24%}} ({{Green|1}} in {{Yellow|7.02}} bosses).

